1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,014
Claude Code 干活，就三步：
Claude Code works in three steps: gather context,

2
00:00:02,034 --> 00:00:04,230
找线索，动手，验结果。
take action, verify the result.

3
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:06,403
官方入门课第一课，五月发布，
Lesson one of the official intro course,

4
00:00:06,423 --> 00:00:08,740
出镜的是 Lewis Menelaws。
published in May, taught by Lewis Menelaws.

5
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,497
它和聊天窗口最大的差别，
The big difference from a chat window:

6
00:00:10,517 --> 00:00:12,580
是能直接动你的文件和终端。
it can work on your files and terminal directly.

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,942
聊天框给你一段代码，
A chat window hands you code to copy

8
00:00:13,962 --> 00:00:16,520
你得自己复制粘贴。它自己进去改。
and paste. Claude Code goes in and edits it itself.

9
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:19,261
怎么改？先收集上下文，再动手改
How? It gathers context, then acts by editing files

10
00:00:19,281 --> 00:00:22,220
文件、跑命令，最后验证结果。
and running commands, then verifies the result.

11
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,360
没达标，就回到第一步重来，
If it falls short, it loops back

12
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,350
一直循环到能验证为止。
and tries again until the result checks out.

13
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:29,058
比如让它修失败的测试：先跑，
Ask it to fix failing tests: it runs them, reads the errors,

14
00:00:29,078 --> 00:00:32,140
读报错，找文件，改，再跑一遍。
finds the files, edits, and runs them again.

15
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:33,708
整个过程里，你随时
At any point, you can add context,

16
00:00:33,728 --> 00:00:35,630
能插话、打断、纠偏。
interrupt, or steer it.

17
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:38,254
改错了？按两下 Esc，文件能回到
Made a mistake? Press Esc twice and your files roll back,

18
00:00:38,274 --> 00:00:40,940
改之前；远端的改动撤不回。
though changes to remote systems can't be undone.

19
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,810
撑起这个循环的有四样：
Four things hold it up: the loop itself,

20
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:45,880
循环本身、上下文窗口、工具、权限。
the context window, tools, and permissions.

21
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,275
窗口满了会自动压缩，什么时候调用
The window compacts itself when it fills up, Claude decides

22
00:00:48,295 --> 00:00:50,771
工具由它判断，权限由你来定。
when to call tools, and you set the permissions.

23
00:00:50,791 --> 00:00:52,162
终端、编辑器插件、
It runs in your terminal,

24
00:00:52,182 --> 00:00:54,571
桌面应用、网页版，都能用。
as an editor plugin, in the desktop app, and on the web.

25
00:00:54,591 --> 00:00:57,150
官方课自己也提醒：它可能理解错、
The official course itself warns: it can misread your intent,

26
00:00:57,170 --> 00:00:59,241
写出 bug、把事情做过头。
introduce bugs, and over-engineer things.

27
00:00:59,261 --> 00:01:01,363
聊天框交答案，代理交结果。
A chat window delivers answers; an agent delivers results.

28
00:01:01,383 --> 00:01:03,891
结果对不对，还得你来验。
Whether they're right is still on you to verify.
